{"about_the_game":"Your keyboard is now a physics playground!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460480/extras/56571ffc27e6ecc8fcfc53727d651784.poster.avif?t=1750273024\" width=566 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460480/extras/56571ffc27e6ecc8fcfc53727d651784.webm?t=1750273024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1460480/extras/56571ffc27e6ecc8fcfc53727d651784.mp4?t=1750273024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>On Key Up</i> is a weird and challenging collection of physics-based mini-games where your keyboard becomes the setting and the controller.<br><br>Explore 24 unique levels, each with three escalating phases, from painting keys and popping balloons to flipping burgers and redirecting lasers.<br><br>Tap, mash, and time your keystrokes to interact with this wacky world of tactile experiments. Every level tests your creativity, logic, or reflexes... all with nothing but your keyboard!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Key&quot; Features</h2><br>\ud83d\udcbb 24 experimental keyboard-based levels with 3 challenges each<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Physics puzzles, reaction tests, and unexpected mechanics<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Paint, bounce, launch, roll, reflect, break, and build stuff<br><br>\ud83d\udd01 Score attack mechanics for replayability and leaderboard placement","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Paint with Ball","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1460480/56e3d5984e4c300b3b0cb88ef64227e977907894.jpg"},{"name":"Get Coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1460480/417980dc55260f0bcf1f1d7d372c37a3ad5a27e8.jpg"},{"name":"Ball in Hoop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/146